WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.470
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.370
Now let's go back to your time.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.160
Your fathers and mothers are waiting.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:23.160
Liar!

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:26.360
Shinigami!

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.700
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:11.790
Wh-Where do we go... when we die?

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:25.040
I've been waiting for this day
for so long.

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:33.540
The door to the Hidden Village opens.

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.610
At last.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:37.490
CHAPTER 66

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:42.550
THE SHINIGAMI
AND SAKAIMINATO'S HIDDEN VILLAGE

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:47.060
Heave ho! Heave ho! Heave ho!
Heave ho! Heave ho!

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:54.400
<i>The Harbor Fishing Festival.</i>

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:57.170
<i>I've come again this year.</i>

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.280
<i>Plus...</i>

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:01.890
<i>Kitaro and Cat-san are here again, too!</i>

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.710
Uncle Shoji, I promised to meet up
with Kitaro soon.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:08.330
Sure. Go ahead.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.340
It all looks delicious!

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:16.130
Catchick, we should hurry. Mana's waiting.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:19.240
Man, Sakaiminato is the best!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.260
Rat Man?

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.260
What's best, you ask?

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.600
Rat Man!

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.810
What are you doing here?

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.680
Where Kitaro goes, Rat Man goes!

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:36.360
I heard something was going on that might
impact all of Tottori, so I came running.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.400
That's the world's greatest
<i>yokai</i> researcher for you!

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.030
Have another drink!

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.740
Thank you, my Sakaiminato friends!

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:46.120
Let's share stories until morning.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:51.330
We already solved the Mabyo case.
You just came for the free booze.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.210
Let's go, Catchick.

00:03:53.210 --> 00:03:55.960
Oh man, I'm a bit late.

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:57.550
I should hurry.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:04:00.670
Come here... This way...

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:01.970
Come here...

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.820
Huh? Who's that?

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:08.020
Come here...

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:09.970
Come this way...

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.070
Mana's late.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.200
I wonder what's wrong.

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:23.320
Something might have suddenly come up.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.370
Let's wait a little more.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:27.070
All right.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.370
Mana-chan?

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:34.600
Oh crap! I can't stop it.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:37.420
Mana's missing?

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.340
We can't reach her.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.460
Hmm. Where could she have gone?

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:45.470
Let's split up and find her.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.560
I can't drink any more.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.080
What a slob.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.480
Wake up!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.650
Wh-What was that for?!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.820
Hey, have you seen Mana?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.760
Mana-chan?

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.650
Come to think of it.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:13.160
It's open! It's open!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:16.960
The door to the Hidden Village
is open at last!

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.170
SHINIGAMI

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:26.530
The last time I saw
the Bridge of Time was 200 years ago.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:35.770
Someone's already being lured
by the voice from the Hidden Village.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.770
Come... Come here...

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.670
This way...

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:45.280
I better go for that soul harvesting
I've been awaiting for so long.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.280
Mana!

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:51.720
That's Kitaro!

00:05:58.600 --> 00:06:00.790
A real nuisance has shown up.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:03.420
I better do something.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.770
Where am I?

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:18.120
Wait. It's morning?

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:21.440
Was I sleeping this whole time? Why?

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.670
Hey!

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.860
Who are... you?

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.620
Just who are you?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.660
Yeah.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.410
Hmm... Well...

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.960
Say, where are your fathers and mothers?

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:39.980
Aren't they here with you?

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:45.550
Did I say something wrong?

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:49.800
Our dads aren't here...
But Ichinoshin-sama is!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.200
Ichinoshin?

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:56.120
Ichinoshin-sama!

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:00.560
Could it be...?

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.480
Girl! Where did you come from?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.690
Where? From Sakaiminato.

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.570
Sakaiminato?

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:09.950
You mean Sakai Village?

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.260
Village?

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:17.410
Look, I'm in a hurry. I'd like to go home.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.710
You can't leave this place.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.130
What do you mean?

00:07:21.130 --> 00:07:24.750
We came here a long time ago.

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:27.340
We've been living here ever since.

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:30.260
Ever since? Ever since when?

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.630
Bunsei year two.

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:33.010
Huh?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.970
But it's the first year of Reiwa.

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:39.730
What are you talking about?
We came here when Tokugawa Ienari-sama...

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:43.070
Tokugawa? You mean the Edo period?

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:45.980
No way. That's impossible.

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:47.980
It's true!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:51.410
A-All right then.
I'll figure it out myself.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.910
Do as you like.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.240
Sure.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:56.760
Huh?

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:07.630
With this hangover,
after an all-nighter to boot, I'm beat.

00:08:09.110 --> 00:08:11.280
I finally found you.

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:13.220
And who are you?

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.260
I'm a Shinigami.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:17.260
What? A Shinigami?!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.120
How ominous!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.850
I'm gonna deck you!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.940
Hold on. I've been looking for you...

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.810
to be the perfect business partner.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:31.440
BiBiBi! And what sort of lucrative idea
did you have in mind?

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.530
It's the Hidden Village.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:36.800
Wh-What?

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.850
The Hidden Village?

00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:43.210
Since long ago,
it's lured many children.

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.790
Once lost inside,
you can never hope to leave again.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:50.280
Within it, time stands still.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.670
Time stands still?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:54.890
That's right.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:57.890
Therefore, children lost inside
live on without aging,

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:03.890
and their souls become tens of times
more valuable than normal souls.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:07.020
I harvested such souls 200 years ago

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:11.280
and gained unheard of success
among the Shinigami Tribe!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:13.530
A true success story!

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:16.370
And this year is time for another harvest.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:21.080
If you help me,
I'll pay you 100 million yen.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.830
A-A hundred million yen?!

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:28.330
So what do you need me to do? Arf!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.150
I've got no service.

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:35.970
I bet Cat-san and everyone is so worried.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:39.350
Over here... Come over here...

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.010
It's... that voice again.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.150
Who are you?

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:51.650
I am the guardian of this Hidden Village.

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.280
Hidden Village?

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:57.700
Children who come here do not age.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.950
You can live here happily, too...

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:02.410
forever.

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:04.660
Forever?!

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:11.940
I told you. You can't leave this place.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.590
MIZUKI SHIGERU MUSEUM

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:21.100
MUZUKI SHIGERU ROAD

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:19.990
-<i>"Bottom's up!"</i>
-<i>"Cheers!!"</i>

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:20.990
<i>"You're out!!"</i>

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:24.640
Sorry for not believing you earlier.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:25.750
It's okay.

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:29.600
I should have explained things properly.

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.600
Forgive me.

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:35.230
Let's do this over. I'm Mana Inuyama.
Nice to meet you.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:36.740
Huh?

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:39.910
Oh, they don't shake hands
in the Edo period.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:40.870
Shake hands?

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:44.200
Here. You hold hands like this.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.330
Why hold hands?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.250
Because we're friends now.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:49.670
I see.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:52.710
I am Ichinoshin Arao.

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.050
Going to foreign lands is that easy?!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.380
Sure! You even fly there.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:00.260
Amazing.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.640
Oh, also...

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.450
Ta-daa! This is a smartphone.

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:06.580
Look.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:09.350
This is a flying vehicle.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.850
Also...

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:18.900
So this is the age you live in?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.470
That's right.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.410
Why do you always watch from far away?

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:30.330
I'm the daughter of a commoner.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.670
My status is different from
a warrior like Ichinoshin-sama.

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:36.220
So you can't approach him?

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.130
Yes.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:39.700
That's not very fair.

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:45.180
Are you... in love with Ichinoshin-kun?

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.680
N-Not at all!

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:50.900
I thought so!

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:52.900
Ah, love. It's so sweet.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:55.780
But, a secret love is too tragic.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:58.200
If you love him,
you need to get it together and tell him.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.150
Get it together?

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.240
Yeah. Tell him how you feel about him.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:07.830
That's... impossible.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:10.140
Because of your status?

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:15.590
In my time, people can fall in love
with whoever they want to.

00:12:15.590 --> 00:12:18.880
And they're free to tell that person.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.590
Really?

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:21.990
Yeah!

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:24.180
All it takes is courage.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:25.550
Courage...

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:28.850
I mean, it's better to do what you can
and regret it,

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:31.680
than regret not doing anything.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.920
At least that's what I think.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.690
Do what you can...

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:41.240
I understand. I'll summon my courage,
get it together and tell him.

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.550
Yeah! Good luck!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.790
What are you two doing here?!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:52.540
I've already told them.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:54.040
You didn't...

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:57.420
Why?

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:00.880
You promised not to approach the guardian.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.800
We're sorry!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:07.390
Listening to Mana made us miss home.

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:08.550
I see.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:13.770
Ichinoshin-sama, is it true that
our homes are gone?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:19.320
Is it true that
our dads and moms are long dead?

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.840
Ichinoshin-kun...

00:13:23.670 --> 00:13:26.610
Being here, you lose track of time.

00:13:27.140 --> 00:13:34.000
I wondered if what the guardian said
was true, or a lie just to keep us here.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:38.770
But... meeting you has made it clear.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:43.260
The place we called our home
has long since disappeared.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:47.840
Even if you can't return to your time,
you can't give up hope.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.280
Hope, huh?

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:53.310
We've searched but there's no way out.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.060
We can never leave...

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.770
Yes we can!

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:03.450
I know Kitaro and the others will find us!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:04.530
Kitaro?

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:08.160
Yeah! He's my dear friend!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:11.160
Kitaro-san, look at these old documents.

00:14:11.680 --> 00:14:13.540
In the second year of the Bunsei period,

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:19.750
several children were spirited away
near Yumigahama Beach in the summer.

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.500
Yumigahama Beach?

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:26.800
That place is called Yomi,
and, like Yomotsu Hirasaka,

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:30.890
it is a border between
here and another world.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.640
That other world is called
"the Hidden Village,"

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:36.600
and the doorway opens
once every 200 years.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:40.150
This year is that 200th year.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.900
Somewhere around here is
the doorway to the Hidden Village.

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:49.990
Hey, Kitaro! I finally got
some important and certain information!

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:52.240
You're just lying again.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.250
No I'm not!

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:57.420
Mana-chan crossed the Bridge of Time
and wandered into the Hidden Village!

00:14:57.420 --> 00:14:59.040
How did you know about that?!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.000
Just follow me!

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.090
Where's this clue you found?

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:13.010
Who's there?!

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:16.140
That's a Shinigami!

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:18.500
Die, Kitaro!

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.100
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.200
Kitaro!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:35.580
That's a bottomless swamp.
He'll never resurface.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.580
This is terrible!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:41.960
Once I get my money,
I'll pay for a lavish funeral for you.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.130
Money? What money?

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.840
Wait. You said you'd pay me
100 million if I lured Kitaro--

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:51.720
I've defeated Kitaro.
I have no more need for you.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.750
Kitaro!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.110
I'm all right.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:04.900
Thanks to our ancestors.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.650
I believed in you! I knew you'd never--

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.030
Yow! Ow, ow, ow!

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.400
Now start talking!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:21.060
It's time for the harvest.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.790
A new age...

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:28.170
Everyone, we need to talk.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:31.670
Mana, we've made our decision.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:33.300
You're leaving this place?

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:39.390
We don't need this place to coddle us.
We're finding hope on our own.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.480
We've decided to live that way.

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.170
We talked it over and made our choice.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:46.190
I see.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.150
Let's take a commemorative photo!

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:50.400
A commemorative photo?

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.280
Hold on a second.

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:55.700
Okay, smile!

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:00.450
Huh? What?

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:04.710
Get back! Leave! Leave this place!

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:10.250
Yo. I'm here for another harvest.

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:13.030
You shall not take the children!

00:17:13.950 --> 00:17:15.740
Out of my way!

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:22.930
What are you doing?!

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:26.650
I just silenced a nuisance.

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:29.490
Now let's go back to your time.

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:32.360
Your fathers and mothers are waiting.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.280
Liar! Our families are already gone!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:40.030
So you got into their heads, huh?

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:43.410
Your soul isn't worth much,

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:45.370
but I'll harvest it right now!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.070
Kitaro!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:54.380
That boy is... Kitaro?

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:58.140
Shinigami! You won't take their souls!

00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:01.410
You little pest!

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.430
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:11.940
Finger Guns!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.280
Wow!

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:22.310
I almost peed myself!

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:27.750
Mana, let's go back.

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:28.840
Okay!

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:30.250
Come on.

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:31.610
Right.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:48.940
Don't go.

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.940
There is no hunger or conflict here.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:55.550
Here you can be happy forever.

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:58.410
Come back.

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:01.820
Here you can live forever.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.600
It's true there's
no hunger or conflict here.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:08.830
But... that's all.

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:11.080
Ichinoshin-kun...

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:14.590
By meeting Mana, we made our choice...

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:17.780
to live in the new age.

00:19:22.120 --> 00:19:23.970
Kitaro! Mana!

00:19:24.330 --> 00:19:27.200
We're back, Cat-san!

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:31.310
Let's make a sand mountain!

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:34.360
So this is the age Mana lives in.

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:41.780
Chiyo, thank you for telling me
how you feel.

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:43.600
Ichinoshin-sama...

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:56.250
What's wrong you guys?!

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.880
I had a feeling... this would happen.

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.890
A feeling? What do you mean?

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.080
Well...

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:10.280
If we leave this Hidden Village...

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.520
I fear we may die.

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:16.380
Even so, will you still come with me
to the outside world?

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:27.890
If I die, will I see Dad and Mom again?

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:35.750
No! You can't!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.340
You said you'd live in this world with me!

00:20:38.780 --> 00:20:42.590
Don't weep for us. This was our fate.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:44.220
No! No!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:47.220
No! No! No!

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:48.910
Mana...

00:20:49.540 --> 00:20:50.770
Thank you...

00:21:07.350 --> 00:21:10.290
How could... this happen?

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:15.770
It appears they were hit with
200 years' worth of time all at once.

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:20.520
It's my fault for leading them on!

00:21:20.520 --> 00:21:22.840
That's why
Ichinoshin-kun and the others...

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:25.590
No.

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:29.310
What you did wasn't leading them on.

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:30.600
Take a look.

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.160
What?

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:41.610
They're free from the Hidden Village.

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:53.850
Goodbye.

